{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_198_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_198","textTraditional":"一、十有八年。春王三月，曹伯須卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_198_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_198","textTraditional":"二、夏五月壬午，宋、衞、陳、鄭災。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_198_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_198","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。何異爾？異其同日而俱灾也。外異不書，此何以書？為天下記異也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_198_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_198","textTraditional":"三、六月，邾婁人入鄅。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_198_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_198","textTraditional":"四、秋，葬曹平公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_198_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_198","textTraditional":"五、冬，許遷于白羽。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}